---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Direct Lifestyle Medicine · Logan DuBose, M.D." bookbar={true}>

  <!-- 1 · Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="h-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Lifestyle medicine &middot; [City], Texas</span>
          <h1>Prevention first, with medical care when you need it.</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="h-photo">
          <div class="photo-frame">
            <div class="photo" style="aspect-ratio:4/5">
              <img src="/images/dr-dubose.jpg" alt="Dr. Logan DuBose" width="800" height="1000" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="h-body">
          <p class="sub">
            I&rsquo;m Logan DuBose, a doctor. I work on preventing
            disease and improving your health through the way you live.
            When testing, medicines, or treatment are the right tool, I
            use them. You do not need another doctor to join. If you
            have one, I work with them.
          </p>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a class="btn" href="/book">Book a free conversation</a>
            <a class="quiet" href="/how-it-works">How it works &rarr;</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pstrip">
        <div><b>$99 a month</b>one flat price, no per-visit charges</div>
        <div><b>Reduced and free memberships</b>so cost is not what stops you</div>
        <div><b>With or without another doctor</b>I work alongside yours, or as your doctor</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2 · Recognition -->
  <section class="section band-warm">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <h2>Where most people start</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            Maybe it&rsquo;s several things at once. Blood pressure
            creeping up. Poor sleep. Weight that will not move. Results
            you&rsquo;d like to understand better. Medicines you have
            questions about.
          </p>
          <p>
            Or maybe nothing is wrong yet. You just want to keep it that
            way, and you want a doctor who knows you.
          </p>
          <p>
            Either way, we start the same: a full look at your health and
            a plan you can actually follow.
          </p>
          <p><a class="quiet" href="/help">What I can help with &rarr;</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3 · The three services -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2>What I do</h2>
        <p class="lede">Three parts of one practice, not three plans. You
        get whichever ones your health calls for.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cards c3">
        <div class="card">
          <h4>Prevention and lifestyle medicine</h4>
          <p>
            The foundation of every membership. Nutrition, activity,
            sleep, stress, alcohol and tobacco, and the relationships
            around you. Screenings on schedule. A written plan with goals
            we check against.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>Medical care and treatment</h4>
          <p>
            I diagnose, order labs and imaging, prescribe, and follow up
            on abnormal results. Lifestyle medicine is how I think about
            your care. It is not a rule against using medicine.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h4>Care coordination</h4>
          <p>
            I talk to your other doctors, make referrals, track what
            comes back, and help you find care I don&rsquo;t provide. If
            you have no doctor besides me, I help you set up what you
            need.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:36px"><a class="quiet" href="/help">What each one covers &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 · How it works -->
  <section class="section band-warm">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2>How it works</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step-item">
          <span class="num">01</span>
          <h4>We talk first</h4>
          <p>A free 30-minute video call. If I&rsquo;m not the right fit,
          I&rsquo;ll say so.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <span class="num">02</span>
          <h4>You join if it fits</h4>
          <p>$99 a month, or less if that is a barrier. No sign-up fee,
          no contract. Cancel anytime.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <span class="num">03</span>
          <h4>A full look, then a plan</h4>
          <p>Your history, medicines, conditions, and the way you live.
          Then a written plan we build together.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-item">
          <span class="num">04</span>
          <h4>You see it working</h4>
          <p>Your blood pressure, labs, and progress are visible to both
          of us, and we adjust.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:36px"><a class="quiet" href="/how-it-works">The details, start to finish &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5 · The price -->
  <section class="section band-tint" id="bookbar-after">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2>The price</h2>
        <p class="lede">The same care at every level.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="split even" style="align-items:start">
        <div class="price-card">
          <div class="amt">$99 <span>/ month per adult</span></div>
          <div class="per">no per-visit charges</div>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>An ongoing relationship with one doctor</li>
            <li>A full first assessment of your health and habits</li>
            <li>A written plan, reviewed as you go</li>
            <li>Visits as your care needs them</li>
            <li>Direct messaging with me</li>
            <li>Every result explained</li>
            <li>Coordination with your other doctors</li>
            <li>Cancel anytime</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <h3>If $99 is a barrier</h3>
          <p style="margin-top:8px">
            I offer reduced-rate memberships based on your finances, and
            a small number of free memberships. The medical care is the
            same. Say so when we talk.
          </p>
          <h3 style="margin-top:28px">What it doesn&rsquo;t cover</h3>
          <p style="margin-top:8px">
            Labs, imaging, medicines, vaccines, specialists, hospitals.
            Your insurance keeps covering those, as it does today.
          </p>
          <h3 style="margin-top:28px">Medicare or Medicaid</h3>
          <p style="margin-top:8px">
            I want to be able to serve you. How a membership works with
            these programs is still being settled with my lawyer. Ask me
            when we talk and I will tell you where it stands.
          </p>
          <p style="margin-top:24px"><a class="quiet" href="/pricing">Pricing &amp; how insurance fits &rarr;</a></p>
          <p style="margin-top:10px"><a class="quiet" href="/agreement">Read the membership agreement &rarr;</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6 · Honest fit -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2>Who this is for, and who it isn&rsquo;t</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="fit">
        <div>
          <h3>A good fit if&hellip;</h3>
          <ul class="yes">
            <li>you want to prevent problems rather than chase them</li>
            <li>you want to work on sleep, weight, food, activity, or
            stress with a doctor</li>
            <li>you have ongoing conditions and want them watched
            closely</li>
            <li>you want one doctor who knows you, whether or not you
            have others</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Not a fit if&hellip;</h3>
          <ul class="no">
            <li>you need 24/7 access. I keep business hours and take real
            time off</li>
            <li>you need emergency or hospital care. That is the
            ER&rsquo;s job, always</li>
            <li>you need every medical condition managed in one place. I
            treat within my scope and refer when that is right</li>
            <li>you&rsquo;re under 18. I care for adults only</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 7 · The doctor -->
  <section class="section band-warm">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <h2>Logan DuBose, M.D.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            I&rsquo;m a doctor and researcher. I lead NIH-funded research
            on aging, caregiving, and health technology, and I built this
            practice to give a small number of patients real time and
            follow-through.
          </p>
          <p><a class="quiet" href="/about">More about me and how I practice &rarr;</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 8 · Common questions -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <h2>Common questions</h2>
          <p style="margin-top:18px"><a class="quiet" href="/questions">All questions, answered &rarr;</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq">
        <details>
          <summary>Do I need to already have a primary care doctor?</summary>
          <p class="a">
            No. Some members have one and I work alongside them. Some
            don&rsquo;t, and I provide the care I can and help them set
            up whatever else they need. Either way works.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Is this just lifestyle coaching?</summary>
          <p class="a">
            No. I&rsquo;m a licensed physician. I diagnose, order tests,
            prescribe, and treat. Lifestyle medicine is the approach I
            start from, not a limit on the medical care I give.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Is this health insurance?</summary>
          <p class="a">
            No. It is a direct agreement between you and me for my
            services as your doctor. Keep your insurance for everything
            else: labs, medicines, specialists, hospitals.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What if $99 a month is out of reach?</summary>
          <p class="a">
            Tell me. I offer reduced-rate memberships based on your
            finances, and a small number of free memberships. The medical
            care is the same at every level.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What&rsquo;s the catch?</summary>
          <p class="a">
            The limits are stated, not hidden. I keep business hours. I am
            not an emergency service. I take real time away each year.
            When my panel is full, it is full.
          </p>
        </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 9 · Closing invitation -->
  <section class="section cta-band">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="inner">
        <h2>Start with a free conversation.</h2>
        <a class="btn btn-inverse" href="/book">Book a free conversation</a>
        <p style="margin-top:20px"><a class="quiet" href="/agreement">Or read the membership agreement first &rarr;</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
